Hair fall has many causes: a recent illness or fever, low iron or thyroid levels, hormonal changes, stress, hair styling, scalp conditions and family patterns among them. The first visit is about finding which one applies to you.

## What to bring

- Old prescriptions and any blood-test reports from the last year.
- The shampoos, oils, serums and supplements you use now(for reference).
- A note of when the hair fall started, and anything that changed around then (illness, a new medicine, pregnancy, a change in diet).

## What happens

Dr. Panda will ask about your health and your hair-care routine, examine your scalp and hair, and may ask for blood tests. Treatment is planned once the cause is clear.

